% Bibliography source for the QRTable thesis.
%
% Pipeline:
% - The main thesis file loads this file with biblatex using style=ieee and
%   backend=bibtex so it can build with the local Tectonic workflow.
% - Cite sources in chapters with \cite{citation-key}.
% - Add only sources that are cited, used, or discussed in the thesis.
% - Use keywords={vietnamese,...} for Vietnamese sources. Sources without the
%   vietnamese keyword are rendered under "Tai lieu tieng Anh".
% - Keep language={vietnamese} or language={english} for human review and
%   future migration to biber if needed.
%
% Entry key convention: author-or-org-shorttitle-year.
% Keep example entries in citation-pipeline.md, not here, because BibTeX parses
% comment text containing entry markers.
